 result←object imagesize arg;psize;isize;yr;xr;pxsize
 :If 0=≢arg
     result←object ⎕VGET⊂'_imagesize'⍬
 :Else
     '∆WI DOMAIN ERROR: imagesize'##.##.Error~##.##.IsNum arg←##.##.Single arg
     '∆WI RANK ERROR: imagesize'##.##.Error 1<≢⍴arg
     '∆WI LENGTH ERROR: imagesize'##.##.Error 2≠≢arg
     '∆WI DOMAIN ERROR: imagesize'##.##.Error∨/arg≤0
     object._imagesize←arg
     pxsize←⌊0.5+arg×⊃##._supp.MyUnits object ⍝ How big is it going to be in pixels?
     (yr xr)←0,¨pxsize ⋄ object ##.##.∆WS('YRange'yr)('XRange'xr) ⍝ Redefine scales
     object origin,⊂object origin ⍬ ⍝ Changing imagesize doesn't change origin, except if it's too small to fit
     {}object bitmap,⊂object ⎕VGET⊂'_bitmap' '' ⍝ Reconstitute the starting bitmap they previously defined
     result←##.NoRes
 :EndIf
